{"3812930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Caribbean Tide", "steam_appid": 3812930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/3d719d5de01728f40009409b0034ce92.avif?t=1774877584\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras_big/3d719d5de01728f40009409b0034ce92.avif?t=1774877584 width=800 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waves, gold, and hidden truths</strong>.<br>Step into the boots of John Nelson - a captain without a ship, a crew, or a past. Sail across an archipelago teeming with colonial rivalries, naval skirmishes, and illicit dealings. Your only compass is instinct - and the journal where you’ll write your own fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/497d04de357c3cfb9cd37c5ddf8dbd41.poster.avif?t=1774877584\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/497d04de357c3cfb9cd37c5ddf8dbd41.webm?t=1774877584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/497d04de357c3cfb9cd37c5ddf8dbd41.mp4?t=1774877584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Sea That Fights Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel what it truly means to command a sailing ship. Maneuvering takes wind, space, and foresight. You can’t turn on a dime - every decision matters when the tide is against you, especially when every voyage can bring storms, treasure - or trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/1137d3206fe2215f630ed344040c171c.webp?t=1774877584\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/1137d3206fe2215f630ed344040c171c.poster.avif?t=1774877584\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Endless Caribbean to Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world shaped by shifting light and shadow in a living <strong>day and night cycle</strong>. Chart unknown waters, unearth buried <strong>treasures</strong>, and follow branching <strong>quests</strong> that lead to power, peril, or revelation. From bustling colonial ports to smugglers’ coves, no journey is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/3eeba41cd1e01fdd100837f934e0cd71.webp?t=1774877584\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/3eeba41cd1e01fdd100837f934e0cd71.poster.avif?t=1774877584\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Past Waiting to Surface</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past isn’t gone - it’s out there, waiting. Clues hide in letters, whispers, and wrecks. Confront those who know more than they admit, and let your <strong>captain’s journal</strong> become the chronicle of betrayal, ambition, and choices you can’t take back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/0c1b06082e1ae703f5417e5d86f06185.webp?t=1774877584\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/0c1b06082e1ae703f5417e5d86f06185.poster.avif?t=1774877584\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and Command</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your own colony and shape its future - or its downfall. Manage resources, assign roles, and keep your <strong>crew</strong> fed, loyal, and willing to fight. <strong>Upgrade your ship</strong>, reinforce your hull, improve your sails, and prepare for whatever the sea throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/65d3d998a4e40075ecaf9e1cfae43e1e.webp?t=1774877584\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/65d3d998a4e40075ecaf9e1cfae43e1e.poster.avif?t=1774877584\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade or Smuggle - It’s Your Call</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some goods change hands under lantern light. Smuggle rum, tobacco, and rarities along dangerous routes, or trade legitimately - if the price feels worth it. Either way, coin flows, reputations shift, and nothing stays hidden forever.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/3d719d5de01728f40009409b0034ce92.avif?t=1774877584\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras_big/3d719d5de01728f40009409b0034ce92.avif?t=1774877584 width=800 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waves, gold, and hidden truths</strong>.<br>Step into the boots of John Nelson - a captain without a ship, a crew, or a past. Sail across an archipelago teeming with colonial rivalries, naval skirmishes, and illicit dealings. Your only compass is instinct - and the journal where you’ll write your own fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/497d04de357c3cfb9cd37c5ddf8dbd41.poster.avif?t=1774877584\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/497d04de357c3cfb9cd37c5ddf8dbd41.webm?t=1774877584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/497d04de357c3cfb9cd37c5ddf8dbd41.mp4?t=1774877584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Sea That Fights Back</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel what it truly means to command a sailing ship. Maneuvering takes wind, space, and foresight. You can’t turn on a dime - every decision matters when the tide is against you, especially when every voyage can bring storms, treasure - or trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/1137d3206fe2215f630ed344040c171c.webp?t=1774877584\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/1137d3206fe2215f630ed344040c171c.poster.avif?t=1774877584\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Endless Caribbean to Discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast open world shaped by shifting light and shadow in a living <strong>day and night cycle</strong>. Chart unknown waters, unearth buried <strong>treasures</strong>, and follow branching <strong>quests</strong> that lead to power, peril, or revelation. From bustling colonial ports to smugglers’ coves, no journey is ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/3eeba41cd1e01fdd100837f934e0cd71.webp?t=1774877584\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/3eeba41cd1e01fdd100837f934e0cd71.poster.avif?t=1774877584\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Past Waiting to Surface</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your past isn’t gone - it’s out there, waiting. Clues hide in letters, whispers, and wrecks. Confront those who know more than they admit, and let your <strong>captain’s journal</strong> become the chronicle of betrayal, ambition, and choices you can’t take back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/0c1b06082e1ae703f5417e5d86f06185.webp?t=1774877584\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/0c1b06082e1ae703f5417e5d86f06185.poster.avif?t=1774877584\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build and Command</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish your own colony and shape its future - or its downfall. Manage resources, assign roles, and keep your <strong>crew</strong> fed, loyal, and willing to fight. <strong>Upgrade your ship</strong>, reinforce your hull, improve your sails, and prepare for whatever the sea throws at you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/65d3d998a4e40075ecaf9e1cfae43e1e.webp?t=1774877584\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/extras/65d3d998a4e40075ecaf9e1cfae43e1e.poster.avif?t=1774877584\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=300 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trade or Smuggle - It’s Your Call</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some goods change hands under lantern light. Smuggle rum, tobacco, and rarities along dangerous routes, or trade legitimately - if the price feels worth it. Either way, coin flows, reputations shift, and nothing stays hidden forever.</p>", "short_description": "Sail the 17th-century Caribbean as John Nelson. Smuggle or trade, upgrade your ship, manage your crew and colony, and uncover buried truths across 10+ ports, 50+ branching quests, and a vast open world shaped by shifting alliances and moral choices.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/4aa0a98e2c45e7c05f12a8fc6fa9e1de1967d30f/header.jpg?t=1774877584", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/87d68dd832278b8d0d8bc41ae0c0ac243da47b42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774877584", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812930/87d68dd832278b8d0d8bc41ae0c0ac243da47b42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774877584", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel i7 4790 AMD Ryzen5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 (8 GB) / AMD Radeon 6700XT (12 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel i7 8700k AMD Ryzen5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 (8 GB) / AMD Radeon 6700XT (12 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</s